      "name": "bubble-shark-panel",
      "full_name": "PMAT77/bubble-shark-panel",
      "github": "https://github.com/PMAT77/bubble-shark-panel",
      "description": "饥荒联机版（DST）及其它 Steam 专用服务器的开源运维面板：一键开服、世界与 Mod 管理、实时日志控制台、玩家管理与定时备份。Docker / 裸机 systemd 双模式，面向国内服务器优化。",
      "language": "TypeScript",
